# 文本统一 LF，避免跨 Windows / GitHub 浏览时出现整文件换行差异。
* text=auto
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf

# 图片与其他二进制资料保持原样。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.blend binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
